THE NODE STRUCTURE + THE CORE MENTAL MODEL
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

struct TreeNode {
    int val;
    TreeNode* left;
    TreeNode* right;
};
THE MENTAL MODEL — ask this at every node:

"If my left child gives me X and my right child gives me Y,
what can I compute at the current node?"

Answer this question and the recursive solution follows naturally.

