━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Visit in order → DFS (pre/in/post based on when you process)
Sorted values from BST → inorder traversal
Build / serialize → preorder traversal
Compute subtree values first → postorder traversal
Level by level / minimum depth → BFS with queue
Height, balance, diameter → postorder + combine left and right
Answer not always at root → global variable updated inside recursion
Root-to-leaf path sum → pass remaining target downward
Any-node path sum → postorder, return max gain to parent
BST validation → pass [min, max] range down
LCA in BST → navigate left/right by value comparison
LCA in binary tree → postorder, return non-null child
